  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup salt",
    "1.5 cups warm water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all your ingredients, and preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1itJUNEzPKwHODCMzyq_5rbpfgk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11126-dough-ornament-recipe-VAT-step-01-f93202624b7f40a4bf1cc57d96ac2e90.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11126/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together flour and salt in a mixing bowl until well combined. Gradually stir in water, about 1/2 cup at a time, until a dough forms. When it gets too difficult to stir with a spoon, use your hands to mix it.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pMFojw3-1NuE9ozbUpzIFrxBjfw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11126-dough-ornament-recipe-VAT-step-02-1-6ab9d8a1c49f450c9f532fc40ec5d50b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11126/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer dough to a floured work surface and knead until soft and pliable.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MhLZqVGrQcM24ZHFo5ANa0dpjhU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11126-dough-ornament-recipe-VAT-step-03-adb91fecaf374d3882ca0d8863d683b8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11126/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll out to a thickness of 1/8 inch; cut desired shapes with cookie cutters.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XoQecNRr4E5PvacQRI8denWl5Es=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11126-dough-ornament-recipe-VAT-step-05-36b68afd07d841bb919981b954b0d6c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11126/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer dough shapes to ungreased cookie sheets; use a toothpick to make a hole in each ornament for hanging.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JlVBZCIUlz5j7J8l6w06QDDMz54=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11126-dough-ornament-recipe-VAT-step-06-8506fb1548284d998bd4187f847a90da.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11126/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until hard, about 1 hour, switching racks halfway through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PTbGwpNBBMxvuVfLWyoryqt0HzY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11126-dough-ornament-recipe-VAT-step-extra-9531dbb726bd4678a0a3eb894c2e405e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11126/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven and let cool to room temperature. Decorate as desired with acrylic paint and craft varnish to preserve. Thread a string through each hole.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rUtjYnsLWQgQJjElmEih6750lyM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11126-dough-ornament-recipe-VAT-step-07-fb881ccaa65e4ca4964f31639448df71.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11126/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Decorate and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/adu-J0rcJDKhLCLln9d_jEDbHxE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11126-dough-ornament-recipe-VAT-4x3-2-09a33866f38446bcab558a6f2ab6c6f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11126/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
